Description:
    Add SimpleForm and configuration

Example:
    rails generate rolemodel:simple_form

    This will create:
        config/initializers/simple_form.rb
        config/locales/simple_form.en.yml
        simple_form input wrapper classes
        simple_form template file

    All standard custom inputs are included by default. You will be
    prompted to confirm whether to include the tailored_select custom
    input, since not every project uses the tailored-select web component.
